{"id":"5fe0a092a852ec82","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-cl-fixed-point-existence.md","title":"CL 不动点的具体构造","display":"thm-cl-fixed-point-existence — CL 不动点的具体构造","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-cl-fixed-point-existence","aliases":["56-thm-cl-fixed-point-existence"],"display":"thm-cl-fixed-point-existence — CL 不动点的具体构造","depends_on":["[[56-df-fixed-point-combinator]]","[[56-thm-bracket-abstraction]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.3.3 construction before Definition 3.3.17, printed p70","source_ocr_block":"91","verification_status":"source-construction-read; reduction-argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-cl-fixed-point-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-cl-fixed-point-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cl-fixed-point-existence — CL 不动点的具体构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6516afd3f4dc57b\" href=\"?note=e6516afd3f4dc57b\" title=\"56-df-fixed-point-combinator\">56-df-fixed-point-combinator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab87a8c0ba50d579\" href=\"?note=ab87a8c0ba50d579\" title=\"56-thm-bracket-abstraction\">56-thm-bracket-abstraction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.3.3 construction before Definition 3.3.17, printed p70"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"91"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-read; reduction-argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 CL 的应用记法，取变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=S(KS)K\">\\(B=S(KS)K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=SII\">\\(D=SII\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=[x](D(BxD))\">\\(Y=[x](D(BxD))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 取任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\;(YM\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*D(BMD)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*M(D(BMD))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\;(YM\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*D(BMD)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*M(D(BMD))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FPC}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y),\\qquad\\forall M\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\;(YM\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*M(YM)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FPC}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y),\\qquad\\forall M\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\;(YM\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*M(YM)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.3.3（印刷 p70，OCR 页块91）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_M=D(BMD)\">\\(P_M=D(BMD)\\)</span> 的构造及组合抽象。由 D 的复制行为和 B 的复合行为，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_M\">\\(P_M\\)</span> 归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MP_M\">\\(MP_M\\)</span>；Y 的括号抽象给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"YM\\to^*P_M\">\\(YM\\to^*P_M\\)</span>。最后通过转换闭包获得不动点等式。本节点保留转换结论，未把构造偷换成总会正规化的递归函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-fixed-point-combinator","status":"resolved","id":"e6516afd3f4dc57b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-fixed-point-combinator]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-bracket-abstraction","status":"resolved","id":"ab87a8c0ba50d579","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-bracket-abstraction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B=S(KS)K","display":false},{"tex":"D=SII","display":false},{"tex":"Y=[x](D(BxD))","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall M\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\;(YM\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*D(BMD)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*M(D(BMD))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FPC}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y),\\qquad\\forall M\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\;(YM\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*M(YM)).","display":true},{"tex":"P_M=D(BMD)","display":false},{"tex":"P_M","display":false},{"tex":"MP_M","display":false},{"tex":"YM\\to^*P_M","display":false}],"bytes":1327,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-cl-fixed-point-existence.md]]"}],"outgoing":["e6516afd3f4dc57b","ab87a8c0ba50d579"]}